<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 7/8.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 7/8.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>7/8. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 7/8	 May 6/7</p>
<p> CZK	0.44995	 0.44826</p>
<p> DKK	2.10071	 2.09978</p>
<p> FIM	2.65618	 2.65415</p>
<p> HUF	0.07563	 0.07576</p>
<p> JPY	0.10992	 0.10994</p>
<p> LTL	3.4458	  3.45577</p>
<p> LVL     23.71099	23.72544</p>
<p> RUR	0.00239	 0.0024</p>
<p> SEK	1.77423	 1.75289</p>
<p> UAH	7.59196	 7.63024</p>
<p> USD     13.7832	 13.826</p>
<p> XEU     15.61637	15.5978</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
